# data_curation: locally regenerated pipeline artifacts (raw dataset dumps, deterministic keep-maps,
# the row-label join) — reproducible in minutes via `python -m data_curation.build_curated_dataset`
# / `python -m data_curation.analysis.row_labels`. Only the two supplied, API-expensive model-curation
# result files (source_filter_results.json, headline_target_curation_results.json) are checked in.
